      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-06-22T01:14:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Non-standard, but well-tested for the properties I want (operates a 5-bit symbol at a time, and guarantees detection of any single-symbol typo or two transposed symbols).\n\nWe can\u0027t reuse crc8() anyway, because the stream is not necessarily a whole number of bytes.",
